# Dataverse Table Schemas

This document contains the detailed schema definitions for all Dataverse tables in the Project Management App.

## Table: Project

**Logical Name:** crb97_project  
**Display Name:** Project  
**Plural Name:** Projects  
**Ownership:** User  
**Access Level:** Organization  

### Columns

```json
{
  "columns": [
    {
      "logicalName": "crb97_projectid",
      "displayName": "Project ID",
      "dataType": "Uniqueidentifier",
      "isPrimaryKey": true
    },
    {
      "logicalName": "crb97_name",
      "displayName": "Project Name",
      "dataType": "String",
      "maxLength": 200,
      "required": true,
      "searchable": true
    },
    {
      "logicalName": "crb97_description",
      "displayName": "Description",
      "dataType": "Text",
      "maxLength": 2000
    },
    {
      "logicalName": "crb97_startdate",
      "displayName": "Start Date",
      "dataType": "DateTime",
      "dateTimeFormat": "DateOnly",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "logicalName": "crb97_enddate",
      "displayName": "End Date",
      "dataType": "DateTime",
      "dateTimeFormat": "DateOnly",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "logicalName": "crb97_status",
      "displayName": "Status",
      "dataType": "Picklist",
      "required": true,
      "options": [
        {"value": 100000000, "label": "New"},
        {"value": 100000001, "label": "Active"},
        {"value": 100000002, "label": "On Hold"},
        {"value": 100000003, "label": "Closed"},
        {"value": 100000004, "label": "Cancelled"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "logicalName": "crb97_priority",
      "displayName": "Priority",
      "dataType": "Picklist",
      "required": true,
      "options": [
        {"value": 100000000, "label": "Low"},
        {"value": 100000001, "label": "Medium"},
        {"value": 100000002, "label": "High"},
        {"value": 100000003, "label": "Critical"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "logicalName": "crb97_budget",
      "displayName": "Budget",
      "dataType": "Money",
      "precisionSource": 2,
      "minValue": 0
    },
    {
      "logicalName": "crb97_owner",
      "displayName": "Owner",
      "dataType": "Lookup",
      "referenceEntity": "systemuser",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "logicalName": "crb97_clientdept",
      "displayName": "Client/Department",
      "dataType": "String",
      "maxLength": 200
    },
    {
      "logicalName": "crb97_health",
      "displayName": "Health Status",
      "dataType": "Picklist",
      "options": [
        {"value": 100000000, "label": "Green"},
        {"value": 100000001, "label": "Yellow"},
        {"value": 100000002, "label": "Red"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "logicalName": "crb97_progress",
      "displayName": "Progress %",
      "dataType": "Integer",
      "minValue": 0,
      "maxValue": 100
    }
  ]
}
```

